@startuml Session_Expiration_Recovery
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid

title Sequence: Token Refresh & Session Expiration

actor User
participant "Browser\n(chat.js)" as UI
participant "Express Server\n(server.js)" as Server
participant "Auth0" as Auth0

== Access token expires (session still valid): invisible to the user ==

User -> UI : "Who am I?"
UI -> Server : POST /api/chat + session cookie
Server -> Server : getAccessToken(): accessToken.isExpired()
Server -> Auth0 : POST /oauth/token\n(grant_type=refresh_token)
Auth0 --> Server : new access token
Server --> UI : Profile from /userinfo (diagram 04)

== Session expires (idle 24 h or 7 days absolute) ==

note over UI,Server
  express-openid-connect no longer accepts the
  cookie: the user is treated as a guest
end note

alt Page reloaded
  UI -> Server : GET /api/auth/status
  Server --> UI : { authenticated: false }
  UI -> UI : Owner changed (sub → guest):\nnew thread, guest greeting
else Page left open
  User -> UI : "Who am I?"
  UI -> Server : POST /api/chat (expired cookie)
  note over Server
    authenticated: false
    thread_id = "anonymous:<threadId>"
  end note
  Server --> UI : SSE { requireAuth: true }
  UI -> User : Message + [🔐 Log in] button
end

User -> UI : Clicks [🔐 Log in]
note over UI,Auth0
  OAuth flow again (diagram 03)
end note
UI -> UI : Owner = user's sub again:\nnew thread, fresh greeting
User -> UI : Asks again (nothing is retried automatically)

@enduml
